We can use continuous aggregates to maintain rollups for the last hour/day/month.
These are just like our ViewViewsLastHour, VideoViewsLastDay, and VideoViewsLastMonth tables.
We can put an index on the rollup tables’ views and serve queries with ORDER BY "views" DESC LIMIT {k}.
Add retention/compression policies to keep only what you need.
